  "bodyHash": "0f0622b6aabf9c18",
  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/355f241db2c195979242b7a5b99623f04ee7c1e5.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/befc2435a7342a6ccddb769f442d64f835d15618.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">***&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore</a> 為必要模組！***</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">打造夢想中的床鋪。選擇圖案、紋理與顏色，甚至能在上面繪製自訂的像素藝術！</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multibeds/pages/current\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品合成表與資訊</a> :</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/948ec107d7d69b862765f1f49368ef0f32eb417f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/4fab7bb587852012e38c6b169c39c095b42cb710.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"470\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/948ec107d7d69b862765f1f49368ef0f32eb417f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RVS4GYo.gif\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">為您的床鋪套用床單、枕套、毯子與藝術裝飾。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g9UJ3tZ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">在遊戲內創作專屬的像素藝術。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ASfK1zp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">提供多種床鋪樣式供您挑選。加入任意方塊即可變更外觀。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j6DYvno.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">將毯子點擊至織布機上，即可自訂顏色與圖案。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FTN3gDm.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">床鋪會自動組合成加長型或雙層床配置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MWS5OpX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">自訂梯子以完美契合您的雙層床。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JyytxgF6/images/948ec107d7d69b862765f1f49368ef0f32eb417f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>請於 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\">GitHub</a> 提交本地化檔案。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>發現問題了嗎？請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\">問題追蹤器</a> 進行回報。</strong></p>\n</center>",
